> zpwg8 plot 1300 -60 1630 10
> zpwg3 src 1300 -60 1633 30
sleep 2
> zpwg8 plot 1300 -60 1630 10
> zpwg3 scroll 1298 -60 1630 32
sleep 1
> zpwg8 plot 1300 -60 1630 10
> zpwg3 scroll 1298 -60 1630 8
> zpwg8 plot 1300 -60 1630 10
> zpwg8 plot 1300 -60 1630 10
